        "created_at": "2014-08-21T11:56:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hazard spaces don't trigger when they spawn on you. Hazard attacks can work multiple times in a turn. Impulsion Turret is an issue; until there's an official ruling, I'd do \"each Impulsion Turret only triggers once each turn\".</p>",
