        "created_at": "2014-08-21T19:51:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"imprimis5\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/imprimis5/48/2387_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> imprimis5:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Is anyone keeping track of official answers in general? I have the feeling they're going to be very important soon.If no one is, would someone with lots of free time like to take that responsibility?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm not doing it this time around, but I agree that having a FAQ for Tactics (containing perhaps both official rulings and unofficial playtester pronouncements) would probably be very useful.&nbsp; We've seen lots of basic questions which are ripe for inclusion in a FAQ.</p>",
